<title>USA: Mid-America buys Woods Apartments.</title>
<headline>Mid-America buys Woods Apartments.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-America Apartment Communities Inc said Tuesday it bought the 278-unit The Woods Apartments in Austin, Texas, for $10 million in cash.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to invest an additional $800,000 on improvements to the property.</p>
<p>The Woods was built in 1977, and is presently 89 percent occupied with an average monthly rent of $685.</p>
<p>This acquisition brings the company's presence in Austin to 1,254 apartments.</p>
<p>Mid-America said it will use its $90 million unsecured line of credit to finance the acquisition and improvements.</p>
</text>
